Hmmm, that’s really strange.  I followed the steps specified in the documentation, and it worked fine for me.  Every time I start Rx64, I see the shake rattle and roll text below.

Attempting to load the environment ‘package:rattle’

Rattle: A free graphical interface for data mining with R.

